  "why": "On the four discrete channels a data emission's carrier is set 1.5 kHz below the centre frequency and a CW emission's at the centre; all 60 m emissions stay within 2.8 kHz. Aether's waveform is centred 1.5 kHz above its dial on USB, so its dial goes on the carrier frequency and it lands on the centre. The carrier is accepted within 10 Hz of the prescribed frequency."
